  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS South Sudan WASH Cluster Coordinator UNICEF 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) (Cluster) Coordinator is required to support a coherent, strategic, coordinated, effective and efficient system of partnerships to maximize reach, with limited resources; ensuring that those in need are well served, at standard, by WASH partners. On behalf of UNICEF as the lead agency for the Inter-Agency Standing Committee (IASC) WASH Cluster, and in collaboration with the State Authorities, the coordinator provides leadership and facilitates the processes that will ensure a well-coordinated, coherent, strategic, and effective WASH response in South Sudan. In support of the national government, the coordinator acts as an interface between humanitarian WASH partners and duty bearers to ensure WASH related needs of the affected population are properly covered.</narrative>
  </description>
